{
  "info": {
    "name": "sun_life（黑马点评）",
    "description": "sun_life（黑马点评）后端接口 Collection\n\n基础信息：\n- Base URL: http://localhost:8080/api\n- 鉴权：请求头 authorization 携带登录 token（无需 Bearer 前缀）\n- 统一返回: {success, errorMsg, data, total}\n\n使用流程：\n1. 先请求「发送验证码」（验证码在服务端控制台日志中）\n2. 再请求「登录」，测试脚本会自动把 data 中的 token 存入集合变量 {{token}}\n3. 集合级已配置 authorization 请求头，需要登录的接口直接调用即可",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection-script.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "authorization",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "用户模块",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. 发送验证码",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "phone",
                  "value": "13800138000",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/code",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user",
                "code"
              ]
            },
            "description": "发送短信验证码。验证码不会真发短信，打印在服务端控制台日志，或从 Redis 的 login:code:{phone} 查看（2 分钟有效）。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. 登录（自动保存token）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.success && json.data) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", json.data);",
                  "    console.log(\"登录成功，token 已保存:\", json.data);",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log(\"登录失败:\", json.errorMsg || json);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"13800138000\",\n  \"code\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "登录。响应 data 即 token，测试脚本自动保存到集合变量 {{token}}。\ncode 与 password 二选一，本 demo 用验证码登录。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. 登出",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": ""
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "⚠️ 后端未实现，当前返回\"功能未完成\"。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4. 我的信息",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "获取当前登录用户信息（需登录）。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "5. 用户详情",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/info/1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user",
                "info",
                "1"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "查询用户详情，路径参数 id 为用户 id。"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "商铺模块",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. 查询商铺详情",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/shop/1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "shop",
                "1"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "根据 id 查询商铺信息。"
          },
          "response": []
